<header class="page-heading split-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Along the way</p><h1>Milestones & recognition.</h1><p>A few scholarships, teaching milestones, and moments of encouragement.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="{{ site.data.personal.certificatesUrl | escape }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View certificates <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></header>
<section class="card achievement-list" aria-label="Achievements">{% for item in site.data.achievements %}<article class="achievement" id="{{ item.id | escape }}"><span class="achievement-year">{{ item.year | escape }}</span><div><p class="eyebrow">{{ item.category | escape }}</p><h2>{{ item.title | escape }}</h2><p>{{ item.organization | escape }}</p></div><span class="achievement-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></article>{% endfor %}</section><aside class="quiet-note"><p>Looking for competition builds? <a href="{{ 'work/?type=Hackathon' | relative_url }}">Find them in Work →</a></p></aside>
